# {{ProductName}}

{{Description}}

This is a standalone application that talks to TIA Portal through the Openness interface.
You start it yourself; it either attaches to a TIA Portal instance that is already running
or starts a new one.

## Requirements

- TIA Portal V{{TiaVersion}} or higher, installed on the same machine
- TIA Portal Openness must be installed (it is part of the TIA Portal setup)
- Your Windows user must be a member of the local group `Siemens TIA Openness`
- .NET Framework 4.8
{{AdditionalRequirements}}

## Running the application

1. Optionally start TIA Portal and open the project you want to work with.
2. Start `{{ProjectName}}.exe`.
3. On the first connection TIA Portal shows a security prompt asking whether the external
   application may access the project. Confirm it — without confirmation the application
   cannot continue.

